 "adaptations": [
  "day-local-store.js (new): DayLocalStore / dayStorage — synchronous facade over IndexedDB happy-day-private-v1 (store values) for the journal-scale keys hd_db_v1, hd_db_prev_v1, hd_db_prev_at_v1, hd_backup_v1, hd_backup_at_v1, hd_bk_nag_v1, hd_journal_safety_v1, hd_test_journal_create_v1, hd_journal_auto_v1 in every account scope; other keys pass through to localStorage; ordered write queue, flush(), refresh(), BroadcastChannel happy-day-store-v1, navigator.storage.estimate headroom, diagnostics",
  "day-local-store.js: verified migration from localStorage (copy, flush, read back, remove, marker happy-day-store:indexeddb-v1); IndexedDB copy wins, differing localStorage copy archived under <key>:localstorage-copy:<time>; format guard hd_fmt_v1=<FMT> left in localStorage for every migrated journal scope so older releases open read-only; blocked state when the diary moved but IndexedDB cannot be opened",
  "index.html: FMT 49 → 56 (journal location change), RO_TEXT; facade loaded before happy-profile-storage and opened with formatGuard right after FMT; rawBaseGet/rawBaseSet read and write through dayStorage after DayLocalStore.open(), journal-scale writes await flush(); init() awaits the facade and makes the app read-only with an explanation when blocked; HappyProfiles.create(\"day\",{storage:dayStorage}) via apps.json day.profileOptions",
  "day-journal-sync.js: store()/flushStore()/refreshStore(); withLock re-reads journal, vault, receipt and auto record from IndexedDB after acquiring the lock; backup, commit, writeMarker, writeRecord, resetVerifiedAuto, profile merge, passive archive and writeLocal flush before the lock is released and apply only committed state; verifySpace skips the localStorage probe in IndexedDB (estimate check instead); DayLocalStore.onChange replaces the storage event for the journal; blocked state explained in settings; storage line #day-storage-state in «Синхронизация и восстановление»",
  "day-account-data.js: capturePendingArc reads the journal through the facade",
  "tests/day-local-store.test.cjs (11 tests, fake IndexedDB); tests/multi-account.test.cjs slice marker; total 46",
  "cache busters ?v=56, manifest Update 56, release note 56, README; standalone Happy-Day-56.html built; shared/apps.json day → day-56 (55 kept as previous, profileOptions); scripts/check-layout.mjs loads the Day facade; scripts/sync-shared-ui.mjs honours apps.json <app>.profileOptions"
 ],
